{"name":"main","commit":{"sha":"9e25890fd63f7ca6c587490ba7cc432f5fdd98d6","node_id":"C_kwDOULC06toAKDllMjU4OTBmZDYzZjdjYTZjNTg3NDkwYmE3Y2M0MzJmNWZkZDk4ZDY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Alexey Zhokhov","email":"alexey@zhokhov.com","date":"2026-09-08T13:43:20Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-08T13:43:20Z"},"message":"chore: dissolve shared/references into owning skills (#1)\n\nDelete the wholesale-copied shared/references staging set (6 byte-identical\nfiles propagated into every repo at monorepo split, 73% never cited) and keep\nthe byte-identical skill-local copies as the canonical home:\n\n- runtime-trust.md: existing vendored copies in every skill become canonical\n- contribution-handoff.md: the five tailrocks-contribute-* skills\n- repository-audit-lanes.md: tailrocks-improve and tailrocks-improve-deep\n- version-policy.md: the 13 renamed shared-version-policy.md skill copies\n- design-pipeline.md: the five design skills, which now cite it\n- pr-conventions.md: removed everywhere; the policy is owned by\n  tailrocks-create-pr/references/repo-conventions.md (verified superset)\n\nAlso wire previously implicit citations (design-pipeline in the web, tui and\nmacos design skills plus macos-visual-baseline; version-policy in the tanstack\naudit/remediate/migrate skills with the corrected baseline-reference count),\nadd the waiver-policy paragraph to tailrocks-document, change \"generated\" to\n\"vendored\" in the two surviving repository-audit-lanes copies, and regenerate\ngenerated docs where skill-local files were removed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d3d5cd2aa3b5a7c1a1645c8bf9641bf4d8e1cd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-skill-authoring-skills/git/trees/0d3d5cd2aa3b5a7c1a1645c8bf9641bf4d8e1cd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-skill-authoring-skills/git/commits/9e25890fd63f7ca6c587490ba7cc432f5fdd98d6","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoBD4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALR4QAFKKcGBI7xKmSwbhxv59o5Te\nzhLQC8jLXeA9My0yslQbHW49pClcBXkBGkzYcvehW2Rt1TDua+BWv88g0mQgwXV2\nqFzdxLNrV6O/QOLKTeqrRcyKb1MMXy/xpEryy/yuBhhDoyYBNOhjyjpTE8O0yo/F\n6QVzyCXGafj1uFmvPss7i9NqvaDmLJRTQ9R2X3LrfgClzqr+j2yrUAXWYDeIjBzh\nrSVZaR5s2ihZHdeWUO5KBphLAX5Byiu13BjgaDnSUZDtvMODJ2za+brfc3FHKthO\nMNO+aErjvq8/fbVNYk+fLCj4KeLwgzCO0TN5By4E5NaNgyJwA4TMpIzMnDZmPw1k\nsZgCa0tW0DchURiURIQ/CWlMDzLWzgTH3QxpxRaNfj/d1MqN+MPdtMGaTXztvsjC\nQA+5wbKsTgJYY/z+X7fi99bm97oH6Zacx4G6hn4oaliVbOXl6F0qkeIJgqpASJG1\ndpDNzCigWFJspqmofNvfFBQmMWhlp8yLQwkRGdVwmTujdDeIJqCqY+/SFMoSzbjJ\nHCmMO8L/3uYo0pNTP9nTIwJ+pL8pVp8c7jrZtWbE8eSfRGM+CkWtP6PIQE0zjwlP\nsLOFiy4M/TItFco9dsVkeJJeYYZxG7mipIrZ+Ivxd488iaShJpUavVCKZB/fbj8W\nar68LgFohD8bga9+zbyw\n=51Ww\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 0d3d5cd2aa3b5a7c1a1645c8bf9641bf4d8e1cd1\nparent 69f88cd5aee9d43818d57ba6a1db83e907733733\nauthor Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com> 1788875000 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788875000 +0700\n\nchore: dissolve shared/references into owning skills (#1)\n\nDelete the wholesale-copied shared/references staging set (6 byte-identical\nfiles propagated into every repo at monorepo split, 73% never cited) and keep\nthe byte-identical skill-local copies as the canonical home:\n\n- runtime-trust.md: existing vendored copies in every skill become canonical\n- contribution-handoff.md: the five tailrocks-contribute-* skills\n- repository-audit-lanes.md: tailrocks-improve and tailrocks-improve-deep\n- version-policy.md: the 13 renamed shared-version-policy.md skill copies\n- design-pipeline.md: the five design skills, which now cite it\n- pr-conventions.md: removed everywhere; the policy is owned by\n  tailrocks-create-pr/references/repo-conventions.md (verified superset)\n\nAlso wire previously implicit citations (design-pipeline in the web, tui and\nmacos design skills plus macos-visual-baseline; version-policy in the tanstack\naudit/remediate/migrate skills with the corrected baseline-reference count),\nadd the waiver-policy paragraph to tailrocks-document, change \"generated\" to\n\"vendored\" in the two surviving repository-audit-lanes copies, and regenerate\ngenerated docs where skill-local files were removed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-09-08T13:43:20Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-skill-authoring-skills/commits/9e25890fd63f7ca6c587490ba7cc432f5fdd98d6","html_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/tailrocks-skill-authoring-skills/commit/9e25890fd63f7ca6c587490ba7cc432f5fdd98d6","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-skill-authoring-skills/commits/9e25890fd63f7ca6c587490ba7cc432f5fdd98d6/comments","author":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198